# Data files
JSON/QC_logs.json

# Generated QC reports — now TRACKED (repo is private; patient-derived imagery
# is acceptable here). Re-add `reports/` below to stop tracking them again.
JSON/*

# Reviewer QC decisions ARE tracked (repo is private; ACDC and M&Ms-2 are public
# challenge cohorts and the Savioli keys are anonymised). They are the primary
# record of the clinical review, so they belong in version control with history.
#
# NOTE the re-include below only reaches JSON/users/ — `JSON/*` still hides
# JSON/users.json (PLAINTEXT PASSWORDS), file_visibility.json and QC_logs.json.
# Never narrow that: credentials in git history cannot be taken back, private
# repo or not.
!JSON/users/
JSON/users/**/*.bak